      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Rockhill,  Balintra  F94 H925\r\n\r\nExcellent  3 B/r  Residence with Garage\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nElevated setting overlooking surrounding countryside,  situate just 1.6 km from Ballintra Village and the Sligo / Donegal Town N15 Roadway,  7.5 km from Rossnowlagh Beach and 1 3 km south of Donegal Town.\r\n\r\nConstructed in 1980 and extending to 89.92 sq.m.(968 sq.ft)\r\n\r\nLiving Room,  Kitchen,  3 No. Bedrooms & Bathroom.\tDetached Garage\t\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nHallway\t\t\t7.25 m.  x  1.82 m.\r\n\t\t\t\therringbone flooring\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nLiving Room\t\t\t4.24 m.  x  3.94 m.\r\n\t\t\t\tlaminated walnut flooring; built-in display shelves and storage \t\t\t\tunit; fireplace with timber surround and enclosed pellet burner\r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\nKitchen\t\t\t5.04 m.  x  3.17 m.\r\n\t\t\t\tlaminated flooring;  fitted units, included are stand alone fridge \t\t\t\tfreezer, gas oven & washing machine;  pantry;  door to rear\r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\nBedroom No. 1\t\t3.35 m.  x  3.33 m.\r\n\t\t\t\tlaminated walnut flooring\r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\nBedroom No. 2\t\t3.35 m.  x  3.04 m.\r\n\t\t\t\tlaminated walnut flooring\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom No. 3\t\t3.21 m.  x  2.93 m.\r\n\t\t\t\tlaminated walnut flooring; overlooking rear garden and fields\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom\t\t\t2.72 m.  x  1.62 m.\r\n\t\t\t\tfully tiled;  electric shower, toilet and wash basin\r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\nAttic -   Access via stira stairs,  floored and insulated\r\n\r\nPVC  Double Glazed Windows\t\t\r\n\r\nOil fired central heating  (new boiler 2025)\r\n\r\n\r\nOutside Gazebo    c.     4.20 m.  x  3.00 m.\r\n\r\nDetached Garage\t7.00 m.  x  4.52 m.\r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\nLandscaped lawns to front and rear with further plot of land to rear – ideal for vegetable garden etc..\r\n\r\nComprised in Folio DL 5376F\r\n\r\nOverall Site Area -  0.21 hectares   (0.52 acres)\r\n\r\n\r\nBER -\tC\t\t\t\tBer No. 107848418\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAnderson Auctioneers for itself and as agent for the vendor gives notice that:\r\n\r\nThese particulars are only a general outline for the guidance of intending purchasers or lessees and do not constitute in whole or in part, an offer or a Contract.\r\nAny intending purchaser or lessee should satisfy themselves by inspection, searches, inquiries, and survey as to the correctness of each statement.\r\n\r\n[OR] Whilst every care has been taken in the preparation of these particulars, and they are believed to be correct, they are not warranted and intending purchasers/lessees should satisfy themselves as to the correctness of the information given.\r\n\r\nAll statements in these particulars are made on the without responsibility part of Anderson Auctioneers or the vendor \r\nNo statement in these particulars is to be relied upon as a statement or representation of fact.\r\nNeither Anderson Auctioneers nor anyone in its employment or acting on its behalf has authority to make any representation or warranty in relation to this property.\r\n\r\nNothing in these particulars shall be deemed to be a statement that the property is in good repair or condition or otherwise nor that any services or facilities are in good working order.\r\n\r\nPhotographs may show only certain parts and aspects of the property at the time when the photographs were taken and you should rely upon actual inspection.\r\n\r\nNo assumption should be made in respect of parts of the property not shown in photographs.\r\n\r\nAny areas, measurements, or distances are only approximate.\r\n\r\nAny reference to alterations or use is not intended to be a statement that any necessary planning, building regulation, listed building or any other consent has been obtained."
